# Assisted room138 progression: air swimming/invulnerability and final landing
# alignment. Real tape, normal clear, onward castle entry and File A reload.
# No health, goal, completion, exit, event or SRAM values are injected.
# Room138 entry recovery: initial map coordinates only; no health, geometry,
# music requests, goal, completion, event or SRAM fixtures.
wait 600
dump title
press start 2
wait 180
dump files
press start 2
wait 900
dump intro
press b 30
wait 180
press a 30
wait 180
poke 0109 00

# Practice map transfer: map 0, X=0x0A8, Y=0x1D8.
poke 1f11 0000
poke 1f17 a800d801a800d801
poke 1f1f 0a001d000a001d00
poke 0100 0b
wait 240
dump selected
press y 2
wait 180
dump entry180
wait 420
dump entry600
press a 2
wait 240
dump settled
until 0100 == 14 0
until 71 == 00 0
